      "writtenOn": "2025-07-21T18:40:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the existing rate limiting is insufficient, let\u0027s enhance that rather than adding a new method.\n\nThat said, I really don\u0027t want to unconditionally throttle full debug messages.\n\nOne consideration, we have a submission under review for conditional logging that might be another option for limiting log output.\n\nAnother option is to look at making more use of MID_DEBUG so FULL_DEBUG is used more for when you really want to see everything.",
